WEBVTT

00:06:28.396 --> 00:06:30.756
You know, if there was ever
going to be a moment

00:06:30.796 --> 00:06:33.916
in the history of our country
to pass paid leave,

00:06:33.956 --> 00:06:37.596
for us to see, wow,
what would have happened?

00:06:38.196 --> 00:06:42.836
How many, few[er] millions of people
would have died from COVID

00:06:42.836 --> 00:06:46.836
had they had paid leave, paid sick days?

00:06:46.836 --> 00:06:49.036
Had we approached this differently.

00:06:49.076 --> 00:06:51.316
If there was ever a moment for reflection

00:06:51.316 --> 00:06:52.636
for contemplation

00:06:52.676 --> 00:06:54.436
for courage,

00:06:54.476 --> 00:06:55.636
it was now.

00:06:56.836 --> 00:06:59.196
And we didn't see it
from our elected officials.

00:06:59.836 --> 00:07:05.396
And the reality is, we can't leave
millions of women behind.